      "description": "<p>The damage from this disease can't be healed while a creature still has the disease. A creature killed by lesser mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-rank Resurrect ritual or similar magic</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 16 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 2d6 Void Damage damage and Stupefied 1 (1 day)</p>",
